      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the disclaimer thing but i'm not looking for a prescription, just trying to optimize my routine. i'm used to heavy caffeine so i'm not worried about jitters. i just want to know the upper limit of what's actually effective so i don't waste money on low doses. like what's the high end of the range for both? if i'm going for max metabolism boost, how much of each am i looking at?",
